<title>FINLAND: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>FINLAND GOVERNMENT LIST (961028)</p>
<p> President....................................Martti AHTISAARI</p>
<p>(Sworn in 1 Mar 94 for six-year term)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>COALITION GOVERNMENT (Formed 13 April 95)</p>
<p>(For party affiliations see end of list)</p>
<p> Prime Minister...........................Paavo LIPPONEN (SDP)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Administrative Affairs....................Jouni BACKMAN (SDP)</p>
<p> Agriculture &amp; Forestry....................Kalevi HEMILA (Ind)</p>
<p> Cultural Affairs.......................Claes ANDERSSON (Left)</p>
<p> Defence....................................Anneli TAINA (Con)</p>
<p> Education...........................Olli-Pekka HEINONEN (Con)</p>
<p> Environment............................Pekka HAAVISTO (Green)</p>
<p> Europe......................................Ole NORRBACK (SP)</p>
<p> Finance..................................Sauli NIINISTO (Con)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs...........................Tarja HALONEN (SDP)</p>
<p> Interior................................Jan-Erik ENESTAM (SP)</p>
<p> Justice...................................Kari HAKAMIES (Con)</p>
<p> Labour................................Liisa JAAKONSAARI (SDP)</p>
<p> Social Affairs &amp; Health.................Sinikka MONKARE (SDP)</p>
<p> Taxation......................................Arja ALHO (SDP)</p>
<p> Trade &amp; Industry.......................Antti KALLIOMAKI (SDP)</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Communications.............Tuula LINNAINMAA (Con)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>SDP  -- Social Democratic Party</p>
<p>Con  -- Conservative Party</p>
<p>SP   -- Swedish People's Party</p>
<p>Left -- Leftist Alliance</p>
<p>Green - Green Party</p>
<p>Ind  -- Independent</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor........................Sirkka HAMALAINEN</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
